{"target_id": 31, "label": "IMC Calculadora Kadence redesign", "agent_label": "Cursor", "agent_note": "Rebuild this page with Kadence sections. Visible copy is unchanged.", "operation": "replace-content", "block_spec": [{"name": "kadence/rowlayout", "attributes": {"columns": 1, "colLayout": "equal", "htmlTag": "section", "align": "full", "blockAlignment": "full", "inheritMaxWidth": true, "bgColor": "palette8", "bgColorClass": "palette8", "padding": [72, 24, 28, 24], "mobilePadding": [40, 16, 20, 16], "paddingUnit": "px", "verticalAlignment": "top", "className": "imc-hero"}, "innerBlocks": [{"name": "kadence/column", "attributes": {"borderWidth": ["", "", "", ""]}, "innerBlocks": [{"name": "kadence/advancedheading", "attributes": {"content": "Sobre Nosotros", "level": 1, "htmlTag": "h1", "align": "center", "color": "#1A2421", "typography": "Space Grotesk", "googleFont": true, "loadGoogleFont": true, "fontWeight": "600", "fontStyle": "normal", "fontSize": [52, 40, 34], "fontHeight": [1.15, 1.2, 1.25], "fontHeightType": "", "margin": [0, 0, 16, 0], "marginType": "px"}, "innerBlocks": []}, {"name": "core/paragraph", "attributes": {"content": "IMC Calculadora existe para dar una respuesta rápida y correcta a una pregunta de salud, sin dar rodeos ni distraerte con contenido que no pediste."}, "innerBlocks": []}]}]}, {"name": "kadence/rowlayout", "attributes": {"columns": 1, "colLayout": "equal", "htmlTag": "section", "align": "full", "blockAlignment": "full", "inheritMaxWidth": true, "bgColor": "palette9", "bgColorClass": "palette9", "padding": [28, 24, 36, 24], "mobilePadding": [20, 16, 28, 16], "paddingUnit": "px", "verticalAlignment": "top", "className": "imc-section"}, "innerBlocks": [{"name": "kadence/column", "attributes": {"borderWidth": ["", "", "", ""]}, "innerBlocks": [{"name": "kadence/advancedheading", "attributes": {"content": "¿Quién hace este sitio?", "level": 2, "htmlTag": "h2", "align": "left", "color": "#1A2421", "typography": "Space Grotesk", "googleFont": true, "loadGoogleFont": true, "fontWeight": "600", "fontStyle": "normal", "fontSize": [32, 28, 26], "fontHeight": [1.15, 1.2, 1.25], "fontHeightType": "", "margin": [0, 0, 12, 0], "marginType": "px"}, "innerBlocks": []}, {"name": "core/paragraph", "attributes": {"content": "Un equipo editorial especializado en contenido de salud y bienestar escribe y mantiene IMC Calculadora. En lugar de apoyarnos en la opinión de un solo autor, cada cifra médica del sitio se contrasta directamente contra la publicación oficial que la respalda, antes de que se publique una sola palabra."}, "innerBlocks": []}]}]}, {"name": "kadence/rowlayout", "attributes": {"columns": 1, "colLayout": "equal", "htmlTag": "section", "align": "full", "blockAlignment": "full", "inheritMaxWidth": true, "bgColor": "palette8", "bgColorClass": "palette8", "padding": [28, 24, 36, 24], "mobilePadding": [20, 16, 28, 16], "paddingUnit": "px", "verticalAlignment": "top", "className": "imc-section"}, "innerBlocks": [{"name": "kadence/column", "attributes": {"borderWidth": ["", "", "", ""]}, "innerBlocks": [{"name": "kadence/advancedheading", "attributes": {"content": "¿Qué fuentes usamos y cómo las verificamos?", "level": 2, "htmlTag": "h2", "align": "left", "color": "#1A2421", "typography": "Space Grotesk", "googleFont": true, "loadGoogleFont": true, "fontWeight": "600", "fontStyle": "normal", "fontSize": [32, 28, 26], "fontHeight": [1.15, 1.2, 1.25], "fontHeightType": "", "margin": [0, 0, 12, 0], "marginType": "px"}, "innerBlocks": []}, {"name": "core/paragraph", "attributes": {"content": "Cada cifra médica en este sitio, como los puntos de corte del IMC o los rangos de aumento de peso en el embarazo, se verifica contra una fuente primaria citable, nunca contra otro blog o calculadora:"}, "innerBlocks": []}, {"name": "core/list", "attributes": {"ordered": false}, "innerBlocks": [{"name": "core/list-item", "attributes": {"content": "Organización Mundial de la Salud (OMS)"}, "innerBlocks": []}, {"name": "core/list-item", "attributes": {"content": "Centros para el Control y Prevención de Enfermedades de Estados Unidos (CDC)"}, "innerBlocks": []}, {"name": "core/list-item", "attributes": {"content": "Institute of Medicine (IOM) / National Academy of Medicine"}, "innerBlocks": []}, {"name": "core/list-item", "attributes": {"content": "Secretaría de Salud de México (NOM-008-SSA3-2017) e IMSS"}, "innerBlocks": []}, {"name": "core/list-item", "attributes": {"content": "Sociedad Española para el Estudio de la Obesidad (SEEDO), para contenido específico de España"}, "innerBlocks": []}, {"name": "core/list-item", "attributes": {"content": "Ministerios de salud y organismos oficiales del país correspondiente, cuando aplica"}, "innerBlocks": []}]}, {"name": "core/paragraph", "attributes": {"content": "Cada página cita la fuente exacta que respalda cada cifra, no solo un enlace genérico al final. Puedes ver el detalle completo en <a href=\"/metodologia/\">metodología</a>."}, "innerBlocks": []}, {"name": "core/paragraph", "attributes": {"content": "Cuando no podemos confirmar un dato con una fuente primaria confiable, no lo publicamos como un hecho. Lo marcamos como pendiente de verificación o lo dejamos fuera del todo. Preferimos una página más corta y correcta a una más completa y dudosa."}, "innerBlocks": []}]}]}, {"name": "kadence/rowlayout", "attributes": {"columns": 1, "colLayout": "equal", "htmlTag": "section", "align": "full", "blockAlignment": "full", "inheritMaxWidth": true, "bgColor": "palette9", "bgColorClass": "palette9", "padding": [28, 24, 36, 24], "mobilePadding": [20, 16, 28, 16], "paddingUnit": "px", "verticalAlignment": "top", "className": "imc-section"}, "innerBlocks": [{"name": "kadence/column", "attributes": {"borderWidth": ["", "", "", ""]}, "innerBlocks": [{"name": "kadence/advancedheading", "attributes": {"content": "¿Con qué frecuencia se actualiza este sitio?", "level": 2, "htmlTag": "h2", "align": "left", "color": "#1A2421", "typography": "Space Grotesk", "googleFont": true, "loadGoogleFont": true, "fontWeight": "600", "fontStyle": "normal", "fontSize": [32, 28, 26], "fontHeight": [1.15, 1.2, 1.25], "fontHeightType": "", "margin": [0, 0, 12, 0], "marginType": "px"}, "innerBlocks": []}, {"name": "core/paragraph", "attributes": {"content": "Revisamos el contenido cuando cambia una guía oficial (como una actualización de la OMS o de una norma nacional) y, como mínimo, una vez al año para confirmar que sigue vigente. La fecha de última actualización aparece al final de cada página."}, "innerBlocks": []}]}]}, {"name": "kadence/rowlayout", "attributes": {"columns": 1, "colLayout": "equal", "htmlTag": "section", "align": "full", "blockAlignment": "full", "inheritMaxWidth": true, "bgColor": "palette8", "bgColorClass": "palette8", "padding": [28, 24, 36, 24], "mobilePadding": [20, 16, 28, 16], "paddingUnit": "px", "verticalAlignment": "top", "className": "imc-section"}, "innerBlocks": [{"name": "kadence/column", "attributes": {"borderWidth": ["", "", "", ""]}, "innerBlocks": [{"name": "kadence/advancedheading", "attributes": {"content": "¿Este sitio reemplaza a un médico?", "level": 2, "htmlTag": "h2", "align": "left", "color": "#1A2421", "typography": "Space Grotesk", "googleFont": true, "loadGoogleFont": true, "fontWeight": "600", "fontStyle": "normal", "fontSize": [32, 28, 26], "fontHeight": [1.15, 1.2, 1.25], "fontHeightType": "", "margin": [0, 0, 12, 0], "marginType": "px"}, "innerBlocks": []}, {"name": "core/paragraph", "attributes": {"content": "No. Todo el contenido de este sitio es informativo. Ninguna calculadora ni ningún artículo de este sitio diagnostica, prescribe ni reemplaza una consulta con un médico, nutriólogo u obstetra."}, "innerBlocks": []}]}]}, {"name": "kadence/rowlayout", "attributes": {"columns": 1, "colLayout": "equal", "htmlTag": "section", "align": "full", "blockAlignment": "full", "inheritMaxWidth": true, "bgColor": "palette9", "bgColorClass": "palette9", "padding": [28, 24, 36, 24], "mobilePadding": [20, 16, 28, 16], "paddingUnit": "px", "verticalAlignment": "top", "className": "imc-section"}, "innerBlocks": [{"name": "kadence/column", "attributes": {"borderWidth": ["", "", "", ""]}, "innerBlocks": [{"name": "kadence/advancedheading", "attributes": {"content": "¿Qué hacemos si encontramos un error?", "level": 2, "htmlTag": "h2", "align": "left", "color": "#1A2421", "typography": "Space Grotesk", "googleFont": true, "loadGoogleFont": true, "fontWeight": "600", "fontStyle": "normal", "fontSize": [32, 28, 26], "fontHeight": [1.15, 1.2, 1.25], "fontHeightType": "", "margin": [0, 0, 12, 0], "marginType": "px"}, "innerBlocks": []}, {"name": "core/paragraph", "attributes": {"content": "Corregimos el contenido en cuanto lo detectamos, ya sea por revisión interna o porque un lector nos lo reporta. La fecha de última actualización de cada página refleja la corrección, no solo cambios cosméticos."}, "innerBlocks": []}]}]}, {"name": "kadence/rowlayout", "attributes": {"columns": 1, "colLayout": "equal", "htmlTag": "section", "align": "full", "blockAlignment": "full", "inheritMaxWidth": true, "bgColor": "palette8", "bgColorClass": "palette8", "padding": [28, 24, 36, 24], "mobilePadding": [20, 16, 28, 16], "paddingUnit": "px", "verticalAlignment": "top", "className": "imc-section"}, "innerBlocks": [{"name": "kadence/column", "attributes": {"borderWidth": ["", "", "", ""]}, "innerBlocks": [{"name": "kadence/advancedheading", "attributes": {"content": "Contacto", "level": 2, "htmlTag": "h2", "align": "left", "color": "#1A2421", "typography": "Space Grotesk", "googleFont": true, "loadGoogleFont": true, "fontWeight": "600", "fontStyle": "normal", "fontSize": [32, 28, 26], "fontHeight": [1.15, 1.2, 1.25], "fontHeightType": "", "margin": [0, 0, 12, 0], "marginType": "px"}, "innerBlocks": []}, {"name": "core/paragraph", "attributes": {"content": "¿Tienes una pregunta, una corrección o quieres reportar un error en el contenido? Contáctanos a través del formulario de contacto del sitio."}, "innerBlocks": []}]}]}], "batch_id": 65}